     <tr>
        <td>
          <h4>訂購選殖株(Ordering Clones)</h4>

          <div class="boxcontent">
            <dl>
              <dt><strong>番茄(Tomato)</strong></dt>

              <dd><a href=
              "http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/cgi-bin/TFGD/order/home.cgi">購買番茄 EST 或 BAC 選殖株(Purchase tomato EST or BAC clones)</a>，來自康乃爾大學之 <a href=
              "http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/">TED BTI</a>(TED BTI at Cornell University)。</dd>

              <dt><br /><strong>馬鈴薯(Potato)</strong></dt>

              <dd><a href=
              "http://www.genome.arizona.edu/orders/">購買馬鈴薯選殖株(Purchase potato clones)</a>，來自 <a href=
              "http://www.genome.arizona.edu/">亞利桑那基因組計畫(Arizona Genome Initiative)</a>。</dd>

              <dt><br /><strong>甜椒/辣椒(Pepper)</strong></dt>

              <dd>如需甜椒/辣椒選殖株，請聯絡韓國生命工學研究院(KRIBB Korea)的 <a href=
              "/solpeople/personal-info.pl?sp_person_id=87">
              Doil Choi</a>。(For pepper clones, contact Doil Choi at KRIBB Korea.)</dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
